                        "source_sense_description": "Avec ponctualité.",
                        "target_lang_word": "af en toe",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "af en toe",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b771a12f-ac26-370f-a9ec-b2a75faecf4c",
                                        "entry_id": "a6ed66bf-0163-3816-8a84-a0f41a051fe5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "op onregelmatige tijden, met tussenpozen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac598401-0b96-4bb4-8b21-65c2334334af",
                                                "sense_id": "b771a12f-ac26-370f-a9ec-b2a75faecf4c",
                                                "text": "Deze maandag is het zo goed als droog en de zon komt af en toe tevoorschijn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ac07726-eb06-45be-b388-10bcb43dd170",
                                                "sense_id": "b771a12f-ac26-370f-a9ec-b2a75faecf4c",
                                                "text": "Af en toe moesten we zelfs een heel stuk teruglopen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "291b00aa-ec2e-43b9-8b8d-72c40fb008c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "f47c3392-c7a6-3fce-8917-d03026a99d68",
                        "source_sense_id": "68b94b2a-8255-33ee-b8c2-d8943ca5f2c2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Avec ponctualité.",
                        "target_lang_word": "van tijd tot tijd",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "van tijd tot tijd",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca4c46ab-f769-3e34-8560-4065c69b3cac",
                                        "entry_id": "50755f54-9392-3b85-b521-8f05cfd86ee1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "met tussenpozen, telkens weer maar niet voortdurend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a82cd37-0fa1-4bd2-8f82-aa5a18fd0e9e",
                                                "sense_id": "ca4c46ab-f769-3e34-8560-4065c69b3cac",
                                                "text": "Het is overwegend bewolkt met van tijd tot tijd wat lichte regen of motregen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "41e86ce3-7499-4f7b-9f8f-63b83445c8da",
                        "source_entry_id": "f47c3392-c7a6-3fce-8917-d03026a99d68",
                        "source_sense_id": "49d7285d-1e13-33bd-96df-7a3b7bbd8ddc",
                        "source_sense_description": "D'une manière peu fréquente, ponctuelle.",
                        "target_lang_word": "occasionally",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "occasionally",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                        "entry_id": "3e0a289b-2974-372c-83af-d03c55ae6573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On occasion: at relatively infrequent intervals, from time to time, sometimes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eed73f00-8922-4017-88fc-32b4e915255b",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "God ſetteth no houres for the morning or evening ſacrifice because they may occaſionally be changed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc991f2b-3843-4a79-a918-92fc3b31b9ad",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "Some perhaps worship only on alternate Sundays; others still more occasionally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a09775f-ee1d-4146-858f-d9b1aac73887",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "The journal, more occasionally, has turned to what might be called \"fashionable\" themes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8260d65-b74b-4b5d-86af-1dadde51a4e9",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "Flames could still be seen from town flaring up occasionally on a hill dotted with emergency vehicles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                        "entry_id": "3e0a289b-2974-372c-83af-d03c55ae6573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On an occasion, accidentally, by chance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7623644-740c-4170-8311-83fb1dc1d47d",
                                                "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                                "text": "I had met Lord Ossory in the forenoon, who had come to town occasionally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0293cd6f-06fd-4510-a8ea-937c20b246c6",
                                                "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                                "text": "Mr Tourville occasionally told his age; just turned of thirty-one."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4da95638-8879-4d05-b2fc-392fa04eb634",
                                                "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                                "text": "[N]othing gave him so much joy in conversation, as an opportunity of giving the company to understand, how well he was with persons of distinguished rank and character: he would often (for example) observe, as it were occasionally, that the duke of G— was one of the best natured men in the world […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3076add-7819-38a4-a430-badf5deafa1c",
                                        "entry_id": "3e0a289b-2974-372c-83af-d03c55ae6573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On the occasion of something else happening; incidentally, by the way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3c26434-ddb6-4381-96ce-05b09c39ec68",
                                                "sense_id": "d3076add-7819-38a4-a430-badf5deafa1c",
                                                "text": "Were nothing els diſcourſively inſerted (as ſome little elſe occaſionally preſented it ſelfe), what paper more currently fit for the bareſt mechanicall uſes, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9c1fc6f-41d8-4873-b060-fde5d291bf8d",
                                                "sense_id": "d3076add-7819-38a4-a430-badf5deafa1c",
                                                "text": "I think it is plain, that Origen, whatever Character he may have occaſionally given of this Book, did not judge it any part of the Canon..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
